          "text": "Container R holds 252 litres of a blue-and-white paint mixture in the ratio 0.9:1.2. Container S holds 195 litres of another blue-and-white mixture in the ratio 5/8:1. All the paint is combined. Find the ratio of blue paint to white paint in the combined mixture, in its simplest form."
